        <mxCell id="9PxguVdvIXVfPsXIymxn-34" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;div&gt;is used to calculate the KW for the To-Dos&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Weeks From Planting can be negativ to indicate a step that needs to be done before planting the plant in the garden bed, for example if pre-cultivation is used&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
